From ba6a07e9efc1b5b857745fcf3174b4bf43ab45f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CarlosDLMC <delamorenacoco.carlos@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:54:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Delete removes the picked item, arrows move it

The item last picked up with the pointer is selected (outlined). Delete
removes just it (undo puts it back); with none selected Delete still clears
everything. Arrow keys move it 1 px, Shift 10, one undo step per run.
---
 src/femtovg_area/imp.rs | 78 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/femtovg_area/mod.rs | 28 +++++++++++++++
 src/sketch_board.rs     | 39 +++++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 143 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/femtovg_area/imp.rs b/src/femtovg_area/imp.rs
